# Two wallpaper sets that have been in this data tree since 2.1.4 and have
# never been in shadowfetch-branding.install. Nothing in the tree references
# either id -- not the look-and-feel defaults, not Welcome, not the element
# themes -- so shipping them now would add 2.6 MB of unreferenced payload to
# an image that is already close to the 4 GiB squashfs ceiling. They are
# declared unshipped here rather than left silent; dh_missing reads this file,
# and so does tools/ship_list_check.py.
